    GOING TO LAY LOW FOR A WHILE - - - - - - I MAY BE IN REAL TROUBLE - - - - - -
    SEE - - - - I CRASHED <material=\"EuropeanTypewriterSDFBold><link>THE TRUCK</link></material>
    - - I DIDNT MEAN TO <material=\"EuropeanTypewriterSDFBold><link>SOMETHING BIG</link></material>
    JUMPED IN FRONT OF IT <material=\"EuropeanTypewriterSDFBold><link>A NINE FOOT
    COW</link></material> OR AT LEAST THATS WHAT I THINK IT WAS - - - - BUT NOBODY
    IS GOINT TO BE BELIEVE ME BECAUSE WHATEVER IT WAS IT LEFT - - - - - NO I AM NOT
    DRINKING AGAIN - AND YOULL JUST HAVE TO BELIEVE ME ON THAT - - - - - - I AM HIDING
