  m_text: "Boy going by the name of <link>Benjamin Benji</link> \nis spreading rumors
    of witnessing\nand photographing an <link>unidentifiable being</link> \nroaming
    <link>the woods</link> near his hometown. \r\n\r \nThis may be a hoax, but its
    proximity \r\nto current events makes a connection to \r\nyour active assignment
    highly likely.\r \n\r \n<u>No <link>pictures</link> must reach the public.</u>\r "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
